<HowtoLayout slug="plan-week-social-posts" ctaLabel="Create your account" faq={faq}>
  <p class="standfirst">The calendar is the quick part. The afternoon goes on making the pictures, rewriting one idea for five networks and waiting for someone to say yes.</p>

  <h2>How do you plan a week of social media posts?</h2>

  <p>Work in four blocks. Plan the week from one campaign brief, make each post and its visual, adapt every post for the other networks, then send the week for approval and load the schedule. In hubStudio all four happen in one place, and each network's own limits are checked before anything goes out.</p>

  <p>Here is the afternoon, block by block.</p>

